WEBVTT

00:09.360 --> 00:10.760
What is this?

00:20.080 --> 00:21.480
Father.

00:25.000 --> 00:26.400
Sheng'er.

00:28.520 --> 00:33.240
Sheng'er Your Highness Prince Ning's people watch too closely.

00:33.320 --> 00:38.840
I used all my resources to barely hide the prince this was also what the Princess Consort.

00:38.920 --> 00:41.253
Entrusted to me as her last request.

00:43.400 --> 00:44.800
Come to Father's side.

00:47.000 --> 00:49.000
Protecting the prince, you have merit.

00:49.800 --> 00:51.200
What do you want?

00:51.680 --> 00:56.600
The Chen family has gone astray now Chen Dao leads Qingzhou Army outside.

00:57.000 --> 01:00.440
To avoid making a grave mistake Wan'er brings the Chen family.

01:01.120 --> 01:03.120
To ask Your Highness for forgiveness.

01:04.680 --> 01:07.840
Things have come to this how can I forgive you?

01:09.560 --> 01:14.040
Your Highness I am a veteran minister of three reigns.

01:14.440 --> 01:19.440
Served Your Highness's grandfather served Your Highness's father.

01:19.800 --> 01:25.440
Now Your Highness has entered the capital if not emperor, then effectively emperor.

01:25.840 --> 01:30.760
We guilty ministers naturally deserve death but if Your Highness eliminates dissent.

01:30.840 --> 01:36.040
And slaughters widely Chen Dao using this as reason will rally the gentry to rebel.

01:36.120 --> 01:39.400
Wouldn't that destroy Xuan's foundation?

01:39.480 --> 01:42.760
I hope Your Highness will consider the greater good.

01:44.960 --> 01:50.520
Qingzhou Army is less than thirty li from the capital if the two armies fight victory is uncertain.

01:54.160 --> 01:59.560
Good I promise you will not purge any of you.

02:00.200 --> 02:04.347
From today onward everyone will be restored to office.

02:04.840 --> 02:06.507
Do what you should do.

02:08.480 --> 02:13.760
Your Highness forgive this old minister for speaking boldly this concerns.

02:13.840 --> 02:18.640
Hundreds of families matters of life and death with just Your Highness's word.

02:18.760 --> 02:21.867
I'm afraid it's not enough what else do you want?

02:22.080 --> 02:26.560
I think to turn war into peace the best way.

02:26.640 --> 02:32.040
Is to become one family if Your Highness can marry my Chen family's eldest daughter.

02:32.120 --> 02:36.560
The two families will reconcile then from now on my Chen family.

02:36.720 --> 02:40.080
Will definitely follow Your Highness with unwavering loyalty.

02:41.000 --> 02:45.400
Willing to follow Your Highness even to death.

